  </div>
  <div class="f-bot">
    <span>&copy; 2026 <a href={HOME}>Sunbright Recovery Center</a> · <a href="https://phoenixmethodseo.com" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Website Management by Phoenix Method SEO</a></span>
    <span class="f-heal">Healing Today. Hope for Tomorrow. Freedom for Life.</span>
